  "story": {
    "text": "On the way home, at the Palmers’ house, Cleveland, Marianne takes long walks in the {WET} grass, and catches a {FEVER}. For days she lies in {DANGER}. Colonel Brandon rides through the night to {FETCH} her mother, and Elinor, {WATCHING} alone by her bed, begins to {DESPAIR}. Then, at last, the fever {BREAKS}.",
